                        "review": "Ladies and Gentleman, I implore you to read this review with sincerity and with your full attention.\r\n\r\nBarotrauma is a game... Not for the weak, but not for the strong either. Barotrauma is a game for a special type of being, a being that faces Increased difficulty with everything else, Autistic people.\r\n\r\nThe sheer focus and dedication this game requires can only be amassed from people so far down the spectrum that they cannot even formulate sentences anymore.\r\n\r\nSo if you have any of these below points, I wholeheartedly reccomend Barotrauma to you\r\n- Autism\r\n- ADHD\r\n- Down syndrome (Maybe)\r\n- Or anything else that gives you the ability to super focus on really stupid shit.\r\n\r\nThank you for reading my review",
